==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*2 [[Sister Lione]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the name, you can likely clear this stage without any ubers, as units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] will likely be enough alongside your standard nukers and/or ranged cats, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] (should you have her) and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] will make clearing this stage easy.

